{"description":"拋物線跳躍到指定點（或原地垂直跳），落地造成範圍傷害。飛行中無視地形；落點被障礙物（牆）或場地邊界擋住時，起跳當下就改瞄最近的合法落點（`world.wallBlock` 出貨 leap:\"clamp\"，落點截在牆前；只有 `flightExempt` 且被搬的那具身體本來就 `flightIgnoresObstacles` 的飛行狀態才豁免牆體，邊界照樣截斷），弧線隨之重算，你看到的落地位置就是實際位置。 兩格選填：`invulnerableSec` 是**起跳的無敵幀**（免疫在位移開始的同一刻就在，⛔ 不是落地才生效；護施法者、擋全部傷害與控制、不擋真傷 —— 那四格是家族語意，只有秒數是參數），`status` 是落地順便上的狀態（暈眩／定身／減速…，機制欄位住在節點上）。","exemplar":{"jass":"A0G3","skill":"07-03 列、在、前"},"family":"leap-strike","gapScore":5,"id":"hero-template.c908c89286a452169fdeb648106cf65dac155753e5cc6b52","name":"跳躍落地","params":{"apexHeight":{"default":600,"max":2000,"min":0,"type":"number","unit":"wc3h"},"applyTo":{"default":"self","type":"enum","values":["self","target"]},"castTimeSec":{"default":0.5,"max":5,"min":0,"type":"number","unit":"s"},"damage":{"default":{"perRank":[450],"ratios":[]},"type":"scaling"},"damageType":{"default":"physical","type":"enum","values":["magic","physical","true"]},"durationSec":{"default":0.82,"max":3,"min":0.1,"type":"number","unit":"s"},"invulnerableSec":{"max":5,"min":0.05,"optional":true,"type":"number","unit":"s"},"landRadius":{"default":330,"max":900,"min":0,"type":"number","unit":"wc3u"},"mode":{"default":"toPoint","type":"enum","values":["toPoint","inPlace"]},"status":{"optional":true,"type":"applyStatus"}},"requires":["leap","invulnerable","applyStatus"],"schema":"template@1","status":"enabled"}
